This setting of the 155CA is centered on 21.250 MHz
and is optimized for extremely high Front-to-Back
ratios.  It has a 2:1 VSWR band-width of 400 KHz
centered on 21.250.  Maximum Gain is 7.1 dBd and
maximum F/B is 40 dB.

Beta rod length= 11.625 inches (measured from tubing
center to inside edge of clamp).  Pigtail length= 7 
inches.  Balun= Hy-Gain BN-86  (voltage type).

Radiation patterns and VSWR were verified in October
1990.  9-20-91  RC


